  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\" data-mw-parsoid-version=\"0.24.0.0-alpha17\" data-mw-html-version=\"2.8.0\"><section data-mw-section-id=\"0\" id=\"mwAQ\"><p id=\"mwAg\"><b id=\"mwAw\">Haris bin Abdülmuttalib</b> (<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arapça\" title=\"Arapça\" id=\"mwBA\">Arapça</a>: الحارث بن عبد المطلب) İslam peygamberi <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muhammed\" title=\"Muhammed\" id=\"mwBQ\">Muhammed</a>'in amcalarından biriydi. <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kureyş\" title=\"Kureyş\" id=\"mwBg\">Kureyş</a> kabilesinden Abdülmuttalib ile ilk eşi olan <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdülmuttalib_bin_Haşim\" title=\"Abdülmuttalib bin Haşim\" id=\"mwBw\">Hevazin</a> kabilesinden Sumra binti Cündeb'in oğludur.<sup about=\"#mwt5\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Hisham_1-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Hisham\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Hisham-1\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Hisham-1\" id=\"mwCA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwCQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCg\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwCw\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt6\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Saad1_2-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Saad1\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Saad1-2\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Saad1-2\" id=\"mwDA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwDQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDg\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwDw\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt1\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwEA\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"99\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:99</sup> Babasının künyesi Ebu'l-Haris idi<sup about=\"#mwt7\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Saad1_2-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Saad1\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Saad1-2\" id=\"mwEQ\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwEg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwEw\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwFA\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt2\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwFQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"99\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:99</sup> ve uzun süre başka çocuğu olmadı.<sup about=\"#mwt8\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Saad1_2-2\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Saad1\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Saad1-2\" id=\"mwFg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwFw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwGA\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwGQ\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt3\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwGg\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"87\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:87</sup><sup about=\"#mwt9\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Ishaq_3-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Ishaq\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Ishaq-3\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Ishaq-3\" id=\"mwGw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwHA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwHQ\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwHg\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt4\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwHw\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"62\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:62</sup></p>\n\n<p id=\"mwIA\">El-Haris'in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zemzem\" title=\"Zemzem\" id=\"mwIQ\">Zemzem Kuyusu</a> kazılırken, kazılmış toprağı küreyerek<sup about=\"#mwt12\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Saad1_2-3\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Saad1\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Saad1-2\" id=\"mwIg\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwIw\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwJA\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwJQ\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt10\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwJg\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"87\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:87</sup>Abdülmuttalib'e yardım ettiği söylenir.<sup about=\"#mwt13\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Ishaq_3-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Ishaq\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Ishaq-3\" id=\"mwJw\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwKA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwKQ\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwKg\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" about=\"#mwt11\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwKw\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Rp\",\"href\":\"./Şablon:Rp\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"62\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>:62</sup></p>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"1\" id=\"mwLA\" aria-labelledby=\"Kaynakça\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Kaynakça\"><span id=\"Kaynak.C3.A7a\" typeof=\"mw:FallbackId\"></span>Kaynakça</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Haris_bin_Abd%C3%BClmuttalib&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\